17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:06Z","closed_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.7.beta4.official [dff2b9bb6]\nNot reproducible in: v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta4 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Show opened scenes list stops focusing the selected scene tab, after a scene has been opened once. It seems to only be a focus issue on the scene's tab bar, because the scene dock and the viewport show the selected scene every time.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the project: \n- open all three scenes in order: one.tscn, two.tscn, three.tscn\n- select the first scene tab: one\n- switch to the 2D workspace, the labels make it easier to see which scene is selected\n- reload the project: Project > Reload Current Project\n- open the Show opened scenes list, and select scene: two\n- both the scene dock and the scene's tab bar shows scene: two\n- open the Show opened scenes list, and select scene: three\n- both the scene dock and the scene's tab bar shows scene: three\n- open the Show opened scenes list, and select scene: one\n\n\nIssue:\nThe scene's tab bar didn't change, because it still has focus on scene tab: three\nEven though the scene dock and the viewport show the expected scene: one\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ef693a8-316f-4d54-8a42-f429588e8c3b\n\n\nExpected:\nThe scene tab should focus the scene that was selected in the Show opened scenes list.\nJust like it does in v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/841afa7e-5f20-44e7-9c02-e7d8ec78c650\n\n\nWorkaround:\nThe scene tab changes when opening a scene with:\n- Scene > Open scene...\n- or by double clicking on a scene in the file system dock\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[show_opened_scenes_list_stops_focusing_selected_tab.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28475193/show_opened_scenes_list_stops_focusing_selected_tab.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119947/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119947/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}